  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JOHA TRUST implementerar ett program &#xF6;ver flera &#xE5;r f&#xF6;r att etablera en modellskola f&#xF6;r flickor p&#xE5; gymnasieniv&#xE5;. Detta &#xE4;r ett s.k. exit support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JOHA TRUST is implementing a long term develompent programme of a model girls&apos; secondary school at Luguruni Dar es Salaam. The objective of the project is to support, provide and improve girls&apos; secondary education in Tanzania by establishing a high standard boarding girls&apos; secondary school. A focal target group is gifted girls from poor families.This is an exit support.</narrative>
  </description>
